Subject: Service native owner interrupts while waiting for real graphics completion
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Native audio DMA continues independently of GX/FIFO worker completion. Expose
only the registered owner endpoint for GPU waits: do not reenter VI/output or
rendering while the FIFO owns a borrowed command prefix. Poll it outside locks
at existing one-millisecond worker intervals. Preserve actual completion
predicates, processed watermarks, queue order, memory order and worker signals;
no timeout or hardware service claims completion. Full clock service retains
its existing owner-then-VI order. Endpoint ownership, interrupt masks, active
callback and source-selected PCM behavior remain the host endpoint's policy.

